Author: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Jul 15 09:52:19 2026 +0000

    Fix missing dividends during databank rebuild

    - Refactored build_dividend_databank_task inside backend/ingest/tasks.py to dynamically re-run FieldMapper._parse_dividend on the fly for all CorporateAction and BoardMeeting records.
    - When force=True is provided (e.g. via Sync Latest or Reparse History), the task now queries all relevant records regardless of whether they have a cached parsed_dividend_amount or not, guaranteeing that corrupted NULL records from old parsing runs are permanently healed.
    - Updated /api/data/dividends/patch (Reparse History) to trigger the robust full-rebuild background task instead of attempting isolated and incomplete SQL updates.

    Co-authored-by: letssayx <56231955+letssayx@users.noreply.github.com>

